<title>GERMANY: Stuttgart bourse suspends MLF Holding.</title>
<headline>Stuttgart bourse suspends MLF Holding.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stuttgart stock exchange said on Tuesday it had indefinitely suspended trading in shares of environmental technology company MLF Holding AG.</p>
<p>The bourse said it had suspended MLF because of a lack of clarity over the company's financial situation. MLF last Thursday applied for a settlement with its creditors after last October saying it was in financial difficulties.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097 150</p>
</text>
